    "response": "{\"decision\":\"established_flaw\",\"issues\":[{\"category\":\"contextual_flattening\",\"target_kind\":\"assertion\",\"claim_quote\":\"The excerpts show no meaningful contextual differences in policy debate.\",\"evidence\":[{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_f03ea75f7faae25c\",\"quote\":\"The hon. Lady is right to focus on the young people in her constituency and their challenges to employment. There is already a youth hub in Birmingham. We are learning from the employability coaches who are already in place. The West Midlands Combined Authority is very keen. The Mayor and the chief executive, Deborah Cadman, are very engaged in wanting to make this happen. My ...\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_fd81d24a2f161d43\",\"quote\":\"It is a great privilege to be called so early in this debate, Madam Deputy Speaker. I might be new to this place, but I spent three decades in uniform. I have worked with many veterans charities across the UK, not least in my previous role as commander of the Army engagement group at Sandhurst and in my Bracknell constituency where our armed forces champions are working wonders ...\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_baedbbee6aec9457\",\"quote\":\"My hon. Friend is absolutely right. If anything, I think the problem has got worse. A survey that sampled councils in August suggested that over half are experiencing high volumes of fly-tipped waste. The possibility was foreseen in the Government’s own pandemic guidance to councils in April, which noted the potential for increased fly-tipping, especially where collections have ...\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_85918c37e9b143bb\",\"quote\":\"I am grateful to my right hon. Friend. Mental health is an issue taken seriously by all the parties in this House, and overall mental health funding has increased to £13.3 billion in 2019-20. It is at the heart of the NHS long-term plan to see the largest expansion of mental health services in a generation. There will be at least a further £2.3 billion by 2023-24 of additional ...\"}],\"whole_packet_no_support\":\"whole_packet_no_support\",\"mechanism\":\"The excerpts demonstrate distinct contexts regarding policy debate, including youth employment, veteran support, and fly-tipping issues.\",\"material_consequence\":\"The claim ignores the varied and specific contexts presented across the excerpts, failing to acknowledge the different policy areas under discussion.\",\"counterconditions\":\"The excerpts provide multiple distinct policy debates, each with specific details and actors, demonstrating contextual differences.\"}],\"unresolved\":[],\"rationale\":\"The excerpts contain multiple distinct policy debates, each with specific details and actors, demonstrating contextual differences. The claim falsely asserts a lack of meaningful contextual differences.\"}",
